{"synopsis":"Seorang jaksa veteran, Seo Junjeong, yang tengah menyelidiki kasus korupsi di kalangan elite, difitnah sebagai pelaku kekerasan seksual dan ditemukan tewas dengan kondisi seolah bunuh diri.\n\nIa mengira dirinya telah mati. Namun, ia malah justru terbangun di tubuh Kim Seojin, seorang jaksa junior yang juga merupakan keponakan dari musuhnya.\n\nSetelah terlahir kembali, ia memperoleh kemampuan untuk melihat ingatan masa lalu, sebuah kekuatan bernama psikometri.\n\nDengan memanfaatkan kemampuan ini, ia mulai menjatuhkan satu per satu para tokoh politik dan ekonomi yang korup, serta para musuh yang telah menjerumuskannya ke dalam kematian.\n\nDi kehidupan kali ini, ia tak lagi peduli pada keadilan, hukum, atau kemanusiaan. Yang ia inginkan hanya satu: meraih uang, kekuasaan, dan segalanya.","alternative_title":"검사김서진","author":"LEE Hae-Nal, Nasulrae","artist":"Gyang Hae","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"7235c50b-7cba-465a-b409-e65c97c50abe","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-07-12","released":"2026-07-12"},{"chapter_id":"186c9873-97dc-4b73-a838-19e5c80f850a","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2026-07-05","released":"2026-07-05"},{"chapter_id":"4c6c4103-1273-44e9-83a4-6a05cf19c30e","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-06-28","released":"2026-06-28"},{"chapter_id":"48dabf92-ad9d-46e6-91c7-ac507e8e66c4","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2026-06-28","released":"2026-06-28"},{"chapter_id":"e58c949a-bb87-4306-a5f3-614d7a813fc1","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2026-06-21","released":"2026-06-21"},{"chapter_id":"0a768bab-6893-42a4-bef2-44a355f0c10d","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13"},{"chapter_id":"f81b15b3-d169-49d6-ad9d-892a1291b492","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2026-05-31","released":"2026-05-31"},{"chapter_id":"fd224425-1112-4720-9fba-2f291a2e7a7d","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2026-05-25","released":"20